*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  btree_compact.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  B+ Tree Online Defragmentation & Space Recovery Engine
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. BTREE-COMPACT.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "COMPACT-STATE.cpy".
 01  LS-TOTAL-PAGES         PIC 9(06) COMP-5.
 01  LS-ACTIVE-PAGES        PIC 9(06) COMP-5.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMPACT-STATISTICS, LS-TOTAL-PAGES, LS-ACTIVE-PAGES.
 0000-MAIN.
     MOVE LS-TOTAL-PAGES TO CS-PAGES-SCANNED
     IF LS-TOTAL-PAGES > LS-ACTIVE-PAGES
         COMPUTE CS-PAGES-RECLAIMED = LS-TOTAL-PAGES - LS-ACTIVE-PAGES
         COMPUTE CS-FRAGMENTATION-PCT = (CS-PAGES-RECLAIMED * 100) / LS-TOTAL-PAGES
     ELSE
         MOVE 0 TO CS-PAGES-RECLAIMED
         MOVE 0 TO CS-FRAGMENTATION-PCT
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
